Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Bloated Contaminator (4/4 trample, toxic 1; whenever it deals combat damage to a player, proliferate). The opponent is at 20 life with 8 poison counters and controls no creatures. Win the game this turn.
Rule:authored-toxic-proliferate | Toxic gives poison counters in addition to the combat damage (CR 702.164c), and the damage then triggers the Contaminator's proliferate: 8+1=9, then 10 poison; counting toxic alone, or the 4 damage as life loss only, the attack looks one counter short
